  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Statistics Cambodia NIS 2012 - 2016 - Local Costs</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Statistikst&#xf6;d Kambodja NIS 2012 - 2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida finansierar kapacitetsutveckling p&#xe5; Kambodjas statistikmyndighet genom Statistiska Centralbyr&#xe5;n i Sverige. Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let &#xe4;r   att bek&#xe4;mpa fattigdom och f&#xf6;lja utvecklingen genom relevant och       l&#xe4;ttillg&#xe4;nglig statistik och analys, s&#xe4;rskilt h&#xf6;gkvalitativ statistik om utvecklingstrender.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida is financing capacity development at the National Institute of   Statistics through Statistics Sweden. The overall objective is to     combat poverty and monitor development by providing relevant and      easily accessible data and analysis, in particular trend-data of good quality.</narrative>
  </description>
